WEBVTT

00:06:29.617 --> 00:06:33.741
of French going into English,
Chinese going into Arabic,

00:06:33.765 --> 00:06:38.503
and all these pairs of languages
that have previously been translated,

00:06:38.527 --> 00:06:44.206
and feed all of this to an engine,
and out comes a machine translator.

00:06:44.230 --> 00:06:48.634
Now, the current machine translation
isn't yet as good as professionals,

00:06:48.658 --> 00:06:50.540
but it's very good,

00:06:50.564 --> 00:06:56.274
and that's purely based on text
that's been translated on the internet.

00:06:56.872 --> 00:07:01.443
And similarly, faces and speech,